Manage Confluent Cloud IAM group mappings.

Usage:
  confluent iam group-mapping [command]

Available Commands:
  create      Create an IAM group mapping.
  delete      Delete one or more IAM group mappings.
  describe    Describe an IAM group mapping.
  list        List IAM group mappings.
  update      Update an existing IAM group mapping.

Global Flags:
  -h, --help            Show help for this command.
      --unsafe-trace    Equivalent to -vvvv, but also log HTTP requests and responses which might contain plaintext secrets.
  -v, --verbose count   Increase verbosity (-v for warn, -vv for info, -vvv for debug, -vvvv for trace).

Use "confluent iam group-mapping [command] --help" for more information about a command.
